OL,3,GNEWSASuspended term for couple who left
OL,4,Adog to starve
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Antrim couple, who left a dog to
OL,7,Fstarve in a room filled with faeces,
OL,8,Fhave been given suspended prison
OL,9,Fsentences for breaching animal welfare.
OL,11,FJason Gallagher and Aleshia McLaverty,
OL,12,Fboth of Islandbawn Drive, Antrim, each
OL,13,Fadmitted one charge at Antrim
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday.
OL,16,FGallagher pleaded guilty to failing to
OL,17,Fensure the dog's welfare, while
OL,18,FMcLaverty pleaded guilty to causing
OL,19,Funnecessary suffering to the dog.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
