OL,3,GNEWSASuspended term for couple who left
OL,4,Adog to starve
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe criminal proceedings followed an
OL,7,Finvestigation by the council's animal
OL,8,Fwelfare team after the police reported
OL,9,Fthat a dog had been seen living at the
OL,10,Fproperty in dirty conditions and
OL,11,Fseverely underweight.
